Names, function words, particles, interjections, and junk tokens were
dropped. The Hebrew pointing and the English glosses were added for this
fixture.

Band 0 words are copied, pointing included, from the tutor's existing
lesson worksheets and class lexicon. They are not covered by the
FrequencyWords licence.

Verification. Every item is marked verified true. The first 100 items were
checked by hand. Each of the 100 items added later (INIT-015/SPEC-006, 20 in
each band) was checked against Pealim, https://www.pealim.com, for its
pointing, part of speech, gender, and English meaning. gen/curated.go records
the Pealim dictionary path that confirmed each one. Pealim was read as a
reference. Its text and audio are not copied into this directory. A word
Pealim could not confirm was left out.

Transliteration was written for this fixture. Gender is Pealim's for the
items added in SPEC-006.

letters.json (Part 0 syllable items) and audio-manifest.json (the text of
every clip the deck needs) are written for this project and carry no
third-party content.
